        -:  377:
        -:  378:    /**
        -:  379:     * Checks if this padstack is tented (covered in soldermask) on the given side
        -:  380:     * @param aSide is a front or back layer (any will do)
        -:  381:     * @return true or false if this padstack contains a tenting override on the given layer, or
        -:  382:     *         std::nullopt if there is no override (meaning design rules should be used)
        -:  383:     */
